{"id":"n63079-1-7","stage":4,"title":"서성이다 · 徘徊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63079-1-7-1","ko":"문밖에 서성이는 사람이 누구지?","zh":"站在门口徘徊的是谁啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"문밖에","meaning":"门外","explanation":"문밖：门外；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"문밖","audio":"/audio/b6c3ad2ee09e95d41369.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15705","senseId":"1","lemma":"문밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서성이는","meaning":"徘徊，踱来踱去","explanation":"서성이다：徘徊，踱来踱去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"서성이다","audio":"/audio/823501079b8a373e21b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63079","senseId":"1","lemma":"서성이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"2","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구지?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b6c3ad2ee09e95d4","term":"문밖","zh":"门外","audio":"/audio/b6c3ad2ee09e95d41369.mp3","entryId":"15705","definition":"门的外面。","pronunciation":["문박"]},{"id":"823501079b8a373e","term":"서성이다","zh":"徘徊，踱来踱去","audio":"/audio/823501079b8a373e21b9.mp3","entryId":"63079","definition":"不站在同一个地方，而是在周围走来走去。","pronunciation":["서성이다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"归属于某个地域或家庭、组织的人。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]}],"audio":"/audio/25e1ef35daa6b9541a5e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63079-1-7-2","ko":"아, 친구가 집 앞으로 오기로 했는데 벌써 왔나 봐요.","zh":"啊，好像是朋友说好要来我家门口，已经到了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"아：喂","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"5","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오기로","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했는데","meaning":"决定、约定（-기로 하다）","explanation":"하다：决定、约定（-기로 하다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔나","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"要和别人搭话或引起注意时先发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"指某种环境或所处的状态。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来；来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定、约定（-기로 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"决定、约定（-기로 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/903014de886664db68ed.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63079","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["站在门口徘徊的是谁啊？","啊，好像是朋友说好要来我家门口，已经到了吧。","我不知道节日期间要怎么回老家。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["站在门口徘徊的是谁啊？","啊，好像是朋友说好要来我家门口，已经到了吧。","我不知道节日期间要怎么回老家。"],"answer":1}]}
